[[File:Northern Ireland vs Czechoslovakia FIFA World Cup 1958.jpg|thumb|right|The match between [[Northern Ireland national football team|Northern Ireland]] and [[Czechoslovakia national football team|Czechoslovakia]] on 8 June at [[Örjans Vall]], [[Halmstad]]. Northern Ireland won 1–0, and these two sides would face each other again in a play-off nine days later, which was also won by Northern Ireland.]]
'''Group 1 of the [[1958 FIFA World Cup]]''' took place from 8 to 17 June 1958. The group consisted of [[Argentina national football team|Argentina]], [[Czechoslovakia national football team|Czechoslovakia]], [[Northern Ireland national football team|Northern Ireland]], and [[Germany national football team|West Germany]].<ref>{{cite web |last1=Stokkermans |first1=Karel |last2=Jarreta |first2=Sergio Henrique |url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/58f.html |title=World Cup 1958 (Sweden, June 8–29) |website=RSSSF.com |publisher=[[Rec.Sport.Soccer Statistics Foundation]] |date=22 October 1999 |access-date=22 May 2018}}</ref>

